#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:195
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:196
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:197
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:198
msgid "30 gold"
msgstr "30 ゴールド"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1161
msgid ""
"I’m here, Delfador! I thought you were calling me for more training, but "
"there’s smoke rising from the forest. What’s going on?"
msgstr ""
"Delfador、私はここです！何か訓練をするために呼んでいたのだと思っていました"
"が、森から煙が上がっています。一体何が起こっているのですか？"

#. [message]: speaker=Ethiliel
#. human armies have surrounded the Aethenwood and are burning it
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1167
msgid ""
"Trouble from your Queen Asheviere, child! She knows that we sheltered you "
"throughout your youth. Now she comes bearing fiery retribution, and the dawn "
"of a dark age for the Aethenwood."
msgstr ""
"女王 Asheviere が送ってくれた厄介事よ！私達がずっとあなたを匿っていたことを奴"
"は知っていたようね。そして今日、燃え盛る報復の念を抱いて軍を差し向け、Aethen "
"の森に暗黒の時代をもたらそうとしているわ。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1171
msgid ""
"I have already been injured. I fear she is after you personally, Master "
"Konrad!"
msgstr ""
"私もすでに傷を負っている。女王が狙っているのはお主やもしれぬぞ、Konrad！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1175
msgid ""
"They have us nearly surrounded, but we can still flee to the west. I will "
"protect you!"
msgstr ""
"我々はほぼ包囲されているが、西にならばまだ逃げられそうだ。私がお主を守ろう！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1179
msgid "But what about the elves? They are our friends! We have to help fight!"
msgstr "しかしエルフの皆はどうするのです？彼らは友人です！協力して戦わねば！"

#. [message]: speaker=Galdrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1183
msgid ""
"Asheviere is all of our enemy. We will fight the invaders, but you must "
"escape, Konrad. Lord Kalenz has commanded your safety. It is imperative that "
"you escape!"
msgstr ""
"Asheviere は我々全員の敵だ。侵略者と戦うのは我々に任せるのだ。Konrad、お前だ"
"けは絶対に逃げきらねばならんのだ！Kalenz 公からもお前を守れと言われている。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1187
msgid "Galdrad is right. Do not throw your life away so easily, Your Highness."
msgstr "Galdrad が正しい。王子たるもの、安易に命を捨ててはならん。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1191
msgid "There can be no looking back. We must go quickly!"
msgstr "もう後戻りはできぬ。急いで行くぞ！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1203
msgid "Move Konrad and Delfador to the west edge of the map"
msgstr "Konrad と Delfador をマップの西端まで移動させる"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1237
msgid "Watch out for the fire!"
msgstr "火に気をつけろ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1248
msgid ""
"Konrad, it took you some time to rise this morning. I’m not angry, but I am "
"worried. I won’t always be here to keep you safe!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad、今日はなかなか起きられなかったな。いや、怒っているわけではない。心配"
"しているのだ。いつでも私が側にいて、守ることができるわけではないのだから。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Asheviere and her army are burning the Aethenwood and killing Konrad's elven friends.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1253
msgid ""
"I know, Delfador, and I’m sorry. This is horrible! How did the fires get so "
"close without me noticing!?"
msgstr ""
"Delfador、わかっています。それに申し訳ありませんでした。それにしてもひどい！"
"どうして、気づかないうちに火がここまで迫ってしまったのでしょう！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Asheviere and her army are burning the Aethenwood and killing Konrad's elven friends.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1258
msgid ""
"I’ve never seen so many humans all in one place before. I can’t believe you "
"and I are really the same as them..."
msgstr ""
"こんなにたくさんの人間が一つの場所にいるのは初めて見ました。私と師匠がこの連"
"中と同族であるとは全く信じられない……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1262
msgid ""
"<i><b>I’m</b></i> sorry you couldn’t have grown up among your own people. "
"Our kind can be a little crude, but we aren’t usually so bad — it’s "
"Asheviere who’s stirred up all this mischief."
msgstr ""
"同族の中でお主を育てられなかったことはすまないと思っている。我々の種族は少し"
"粗野なところはあるが、普段はさすがにこれほどではない ── このようになってし"
"まったのは Asheviere のせいだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1266
msgid ""
"And if my suspicions are true, this is merely a small part of the greater "
"whole of her armies! We must get out of this forest so we can see what else "
"is going on."
msgstr ""
"それに、私の推測が正しければ、ここの部隊は女王の軍勢のほんの一部に過ぎないの"
"だ！この森を抜け出し、他の場所で何が起きているのか確認しなければ。"

#. [message]: type=Cavalryman # their armored helm looks more intimidating than our Bowman or Spearman portraits
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1278
msgid "Surround the enclaves! Don’t let anyone escape!"
msgstr "敵を取り囲め！誰一人逃がすな！"

#. [message]: speaker=Galdrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1297
msgid "I am Galdrad. You will have to fight me to get any further!"
msgstr "私は Galdrad。先に進みたいのなら私を倒してからにしろ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#. said when Konrad attacks / is attacked
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1318
msgid "Leave my home alone, you villain!"
msgstr "悪党め、私の家に手を出すな！"

#. [message]
#. Asheviere's official stance is that Konrad is a fraud. At this point, the player believes Konrad is the true prince
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1323
msgid ""
"You’re just an imposter! Everyone knows the real Prince Konrad died long ago."
msgstr "黙れ偽者め！本物の Konrad 王子はずっと前に死んだ！みんな知っている！"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said when Delfador attacks. The unit flees off the map before Delfador can deal damage
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1336
msgid "Oh no, it’s HIM, it’s Delfador THE GREAT! Get me out of here!"
msgstr ""
"そんな、これは… こいつは<b>偉大なる Delfador</b> だ！嫌だ、死にたくない！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. an enemy has just fled, even before Delfador got a chance to attack
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1358
msgid "My reputation precedes me."
msgstr "私の名も捨てたものではないな。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has killed 10 enemies, and the player has earned an achievement
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1385
msgid "Only fools dare oppose me."
msgstr "死にたい者だけ前に出よ。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1399
msgid ""
"Wow, you’ve defeated all the invaders and saved the Aethenwood! I didn’t "
"expect this to be possible, so if you’re reading this message in-game you’ve "
"exceeded all expectations! (or you’re cheating to see what happens / using "
"overpowered add-ons)"
msgstr ""
"おお、全ての侵略者を倒し、Aethen の森を守りきりましたか！こんなことが起きると"
"は思っていませんでした。ゲーム中でこのメッセージを読んでいるのであれば、あな"
"たは我々の予想を完全に上回ったことになります！（さもなくば、何かチートを使っ"
"たり、特殊なアドオンを使ったのでしょう）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1404
msgid ""
"Unfortunately this breaks the story, so for the rest of the campaign we’re "
"going to have to pretend that this never happened, okay?"
msgstr ""
"とはいえ、これでは物語が台無しですので、こんなことは起きなかったという体で物"
"語を進めますよ。良いですね？"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1417
msgid "Impossible! I must report back to the queen."
msgstr "ありえない！女王陛下に報告しなければ。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1440
msgid "Hurry, Delfador! I’m not leaving without you."
msgstr "Delfador、急いで！師匠を置いて行くことはできない。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1454
msgid "Hurry along, Konrad! We leave together, or not at all."
msgstr "Konrad、急ぐのだ！共に行かねば意味が無い。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1480
msgid "Time to go, Konrad! Come on!"
msgstr "行くぞ、Konrad！急ぐのだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1484
msgid ""
"Of course you are right, Delfador. But what will become of our friends here?"
msgstr ""
"Delfador、あなたが正しいことは理解しています。しかし、我々の友はどうなってし"
"まうのでしょう？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1488
msgid ""
"The elves will fight. They may even prevail. But I fear things do not bode "
"well for them. Let us not speak of it now. Onward!"
msgstr ""
"エルフは戦うであろう。勝ち残れるかもしれないが、果たしてそううまく転ぶだろう"
"か。ともあれ、今は前に進め！全ては生き延びてからだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1504
msgid "Hurry, hurry! We have but a moment left."
msgstr "急げ、急ぐのだ！もう余裕がないぞ。"

#. [message]: role=halberdier
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1515
msgid ""
"General, we’ve seized the western forest and occupied the elf-roads! The "
"rest of the men will be here shortly."
msgstr ""
"将軍、西の森を押さえ、エルフの道を封鎖しました！増援もすぐに到着します。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/01_The_Elves_Besieged.cfg:1519
msgid "We have run out of time! There can be no more escape..."
msgstr "間に合わなかったか！もう逃げられぬ……"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:192
msgid "Quillan"
msgstr "Quillan"

#. [unit]: id=Tanyth, type=Elvish Avenger, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:210
msgid "Tanyth"
msgstr "Tanyth"

#. [message]: speaker=Quillan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:254
msgid ""
"Master Konrad, I am pleased to see that you have escaped! And even more "
"pleased to see that you have returned."
msgstr ""
"Konrad、うまく逃げ出せたのか！それはよかった。それに、こうして戻ってきてくれ"
"て、本当に嬉しい。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:259
msgid ""
"What is the matter, Quillan? We had planned for you to all go into hiding "
"after Konrad and I fled, if you could not defeat the attackers. Yet the "
"fighting continues."
msgstr ""
"Quillan、何があったのだ？侵略者を撃退できなかった場合、Konrad と私を逃がした"
"ら全員で身を隠す予定だったはずだ。なぜ戦闘が継続している？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:261
msgid ""
"I suspect Elensefar to be under siege as well — I cannot leave Maddock to "
"fight alone, yet neither can I leave you elves to be slaughtered."
msgstr ""
"今頃は Elensefar も包囲されているかもしれぬ ── Maddock を一人で戦わせるわけに"
"もいかないが、エルフが虐殺されるのを見過ごすこともできぬ。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:266
msgid ""
"Quillan, what’s going on? You were all to have gone into hiding after I "
"fled, if you could not defeat the attackers, but I still see fires and "
"fighting in the distance!"
msgstr ""
"Quillan、一体どういうことだろう？侵略者を撃退できない場合、私を逃がしたら皆で"
"身を隠す予定だったはず。しかし、あちらではまだ炎が残っていて、戦闘も続いてい"
"る！"

#. [message]: speaker=Quillan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:271
msgid ""
"Our lines have been broken; men pour into the Aethenwood. The marshals are "
"coordinating a retreat, but are being harried at every step."
msgstr ""
"人間が Aethen の森に押し寄せ、我らの戦線は崩壊した。将軍達は撤退を指揮してい"
"るが、執拗に妨害を受けている。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader5
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:275
msgid "Don’t let them get away! The queen demands a total victory!"
msgstr "奴らを逃がすな！女王陛下は完全なる勝利をお望みだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:279
msgid ""
"Kill any who resist, but take the rest alive. We need prisoners for "
"interrogation and slaves for the mines!"
msgstr ""
"逆らう者は殺せ、それ以外は生け捕りにしろ。情報を取るためにも、鉱山で使い潰す"
"ためにも、囚人や奴隷は必要だ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Quillan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:285
msgid ""
"My riders and I are the first to break free of our encirclement! We are "
"swift enough to escape the spears, but our slower brethren may be caught as "
"they retreat."
msgstr ""
"私と騎兵達は真っ先に包囲を突破できた！素早い我々であれば敵の槍をかいくぐるこ"
"ともできるが、他の仲間たちはそう容易く撤退できない。"

#. [message]: speaker=Quillan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:289
msgid ""
"They will be here soon. Konrad, you must help us all reach safety across the "
"river!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad、仲間たちもすぐにここまでやってくるだろう。我々が川を渡るのを手助けし"
"てくれ！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. $dead_elves is a number; probably between 0 and 20
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:300
msgid "Survive until all elves escape or die ($dead_elves dead so far)"
msgstr ""
"全てのエルフが逃げるか死ぬかするまで生き延びる（これまでに $dead_elves 人が死"
"亡）"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true' color='#A9A9A9'>
#. if 15 or fewer elves die, Konrad will learn to recruit Elvish Archers
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:306
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:313
msgid "15 or fewer deaths: recruit Elvish Archers"
msgstr "死者 15 人以下：「エルフの射手」を雇用可能"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true' color='#A9A9A9'>
#. if 10 or fewer elves die, Konrad will learn to recruit Elvish Scouts
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:322
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:329
msgid "10 or fewer deaths: recruit Elvish Scouts"
msgstr "死者 10 人以下：「エルフの斥候」を雇用可能"

#. [objective]: condition=win, description=  
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true' color='#A9A9A9'>  
#. if 5 or fewer elves die, Konrad will learn to recruit Elvish Fighters
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:339
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:346
msgid "5 or fewer deaths: recruit Elvish Fighters"
msgstr "死者 5 人以下：「エルフの戦士」を雇用可能"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:383
msgid ""
"The elves are going south across the river, but we must stand our ground and "
"help them escape!"
msgstr ""
"エルフたちは川を渡って南へ向かっている。私たちはここで踏ん張り、脱出を助ける"
"のだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:406
msgid "I have reached the southern shore! Scatter into the deep forest!"
msgstr "南岸に着いたぞ！森の深部へ、散り散りになって逃げるぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:420
msgid ""
"Will none of you stay and help fight? If we all stand together, surely we "
"can resist the invaders!"
msgstr ""
"誰もここにとどまって戦わないのか？力を合わせれば侵略者に抵抗できるはず！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:424
msgid ""
"To stand together is to fall together, Konrad. We defended our homes in the "
"east as best we could, but now the decision has been made to scatter, not to "
"fight."
msgstr ""
"Konrad、一緒に戦えば一緒に死ぬだけだ。我々も死に物狂いで東にある住処を守ろう"
"としていた。それでも逃げるという決断が下されたのだ。今は戦うべきじゃない。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:428
msgid ""
"The Aethenwood is but a backwater compared to Wesmere or the Lintanir; the "
"might of Wesnoth is beyond our capacity to withstand. We must scatter and "
"hide if we wish any hope of evading your kin."
msgstr ""
"Aethen には Wesmere や Lintanir ほどの規模は無い。Wesnoth の力に対抗すること"
"は不可能だ。お前の同族から逃れるには散らばって身を隠す他無い。"

#. [message]: role=speaker {FILTER_LOCATION x,y,radius=44,7,4}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:452
msgid ""
"Be swift, friends. We must cross the river and vanish into the southern "
"woods before our pursuers catch us!"
msgstr "急ごう。追っ手に捕まる前に、川を渡って南の森へ身を隠さないと！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:473
msgid "Where are my fencers? They should have started their attack by now."
msgstr "剣術士共は何をしている？今頃には攻撃を始めている予定だったはずだ。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:478
msgid "Aramis"
msgstr "Aramis"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:485
msgid ""
"Sorry for the delay, Lieutenant! We’re finally in position, and ready to "
"help intercept the elves."
msgstr ""
"遅参してしまい誠に申し訳ありません、指揮官殿！ようやく配置につけました。エル"
"フを足止めする準備は万端です。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:521
msgid ""
"How many more elves are left to evacuate from the east-halls? We cannot keep "
"fighting forever!"
msgstr ""
"東から避難するエルフはあとどれくらいいるんだ？我々も、いつまでも戦いつづける"
"ことはできない！"

#. [message]: role=speaker {FILTER_LOCATION x,y,radius=44,7,4}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:526
msgid ""
"Not many. Galdrad is managing the rest of the retreat — you will see him "
"soon!"
msgstr ""
"あと少しだけ。Galdrad が率いている一団が最後のはず ── もうすぐここまで来るで"
"しょう！"

#. [message]: role=speaker {FILTER_LOCATION x,y,radius=44,7,4}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:532
msgid ""
"Not many. Ethiliel is managing the rest of the retreat — you will see her "
"soon!"
msgstr ""
"あと少しだけ。Ethiliel が率いている一団が最後のはず ── もうすぐここまで来るで"
"しょう！"

#. [message]: role=speaker {FILTER_LOCATION x,y,radius=44,7,4}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:538
msgid ""
"Not many. Tanyth is managing the rest of the retreat — you will see her soon!"
msgstr ""
"あと少しだけ。Tanyth が率いている一団が最後のはず ── もうすぐここまで来るで"
"しょう！"

#. [message]: id=$elf_leader.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:567
msgid ""
"Konrad, I lead the last of the evacuees — we shall make for the ford at "
"once. But be wary, for the human general comes nipping at our heels!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad、これが最後の避難者だ ── 我々は速やかに川を渡る。だが油断するな。人間"
"の将軍が我々のすぐ後を追って来ている！"

#. [message]: id=$elf_leader.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:568
msgid ""
"female^Konrad, I lead the last of the evacuees — we shall make for the ford "
"at once. But be wary, for the human general comes nipping at our heels!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad、これが最後の避難者よ ── 私達も速やかに川を渡るつもり。でも、気をつけ"
"なさい。人間の将軍が私達のすぐ後を追って来ているから！"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:580
msgid ""
"Keep pushing forward — don’t let any more of them escape. Twenty gold pieces "
"for whoever takes the head of their leader!"
msgstr ""
"前へ進み続けよ ── これ以上は逃すな！奴らの指揮官を倒した者には 20 ゴールドを"
"出すぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:584
msgid ""
"... is that Konrad? The pretender prince!? He’s returned! We have an "
"opportunity to make up for our previous failure — men, seize him at once!"
msgstr ""
"…あれは Konrad？偽者の王子！？戻ってきたのか！兵よ、奴を捕らえろ ── これは失"
"敗を挽回する絶好の機会だぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:651
msgid "You should never have attacked my home, you villain!"
msgstr "よくも私の家を襲ってくれたな、この悪党め！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:659
msgid ""
"That’s the last of their leaders defeated! With Wesnoth beaten back, even if "
"only temporarily, the rest of the elves can safely evacuate."
msgstr ""
"これが最後の敵リーダーだ！一時凌ぎにしかならないだろうが、ここの Wesnoth 軍は"
"撃退することができた。これで残りのエルフ達は安全に避難できるだろう。"

#. [message]: role=victory_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:685
msgid ""
"Scatter to the south; scatter to the west! Spread ourselves in hiding across "
"the entire wood, and they shall never be able to root us out."
msgstr ""
"南へ散れ、西へ散れ！森の隅々に散らばって身を隠せば奴らに我々は見つけられな"
"い。"

#. [message]: role=victory_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:713
msgid ""
"You have my gratitude, friend Konrad. Without your help, this would surely "
"have been a great slaughter. Allow us to aid you in return."
msgstr ""
"Konrad、本当に感謝する。お前の助けがなければ、もっとひどい虐殺となっていたは"
"ずだ。このお礼として、我々にもお前を助けさせてくれ。"

#. [message]: role=victory_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:720
msgid ""
"With so many of our number safely escaped, our archers, fighter, and scouts "
"all stand ready to join you on your journey!"
msgstr ""
"これだけ多くの者が無事に逃れられたのだから、射手、戦士、そして斥候達をお前の"
"旅に同行させよう！"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:722
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Elvish Archers, Fighters, and Scouts!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad は「エルフの射手」、「エルフの戦士」、「エルフの斥候」を雇用できるよう"
"になりました！"

#. [message]: role=victory_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:729
msgid ""
"Though some of our number have fallen, many have escaped to safety! Our "
"archers and scouts both stand ready to join you on your journey."
msgstr ""
"何人かは残念なことになったが、それでも多くの者が逃れることができた！そこで、"
"射手と斥候をお前の旅に同行させたいと思う。"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:731
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Elvish Archers and Scouts!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad は「エルフの射手」と「エルフの斥候」を雇用できるようになりました！"

#. [message]: role=victory_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:739
msgid ""
"Though many of our number have fallen, at least some have escaped. Our "
"archers stand ready to join you on your journey."
msgstr ""
"多くの者が倒れたが、ある程度は避難することができた。そこで、射手達をお前の旅"
"に同行させたいと思う。"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:741
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Elvish Archers!"
msgstr "Konrad は「エルフの射手」を雇用できるようになりました！"

#. [message]: role=victory_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:747
msgid ""
"Yet even with your aid, only a scant few of us elves have escaped. I fear "
"that none of our number can be spared to join you on your journey."
msgstr ""
"しかし、お前の手を借りても、わずかな者しか逃げ延びられなかった。申し訳ない"
"が、これではお前の旅に人手を出すことはできそうにない。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:757
msgid ""
"Now, young prince, it is time for us to make our escape as well. Be swift — "
"make for the western forest!"
msgstr ""
"さて、若き王子よ。我々もそろそろ引き際であろう。急ぐぞ ── 西の森へ向かうぞ！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/02_Flight_of_the_Elves.cfg:758
msgid ""
"Now it’s time for us to make our escape too. Quick, make for the western "
"forest!"
msgstr "では我々もそろそろ逃げ出さなければ。急げ、西の森へ向かうんだ！"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:15
msgid "scenario name^Blackwater Port"
msgstr "黒水港"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Mokolo Qimur
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:82
msgid "Mokolo Qimur"
msgstr "Mokolo Qimur"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Mokolo Qimur
#. [side]: type={TYPE}, id={ID}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:88
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:78
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:48
msgid "Clan Foxtail"
msgstr "Foxtail 氏族"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:163
msgid "Rebels"
msgstr "反乱軍"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:300
msgid "Uncle Kaylan, we’re here! Are you alright? What can I do to help?"
msgstr ""
"Kaylan おじさん、我々も来ました！ご無事ですか？どうすればお役に立てますか？"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:305
msgid ""
"Welcome Delfador, welcome Konrad! It is an honor to once again lay eyes upon "
"the true heir of Wesnoth. The false queen’s forces have caught us "
"unprepared, but the bulk of my riders shall soon return to rout the enemy "
"and seize our victory!"
msgstr ""
"Delfador に Konrad、よく来てくれた！Wesnoth の真の後継者と再び対面できて大変"
"光栄だ。偽りの女王の軍勢に不意を突かれたが、我が軍の主力もすぐに戻る。それま"
"で耐えれば容易に敵を撃退できよう！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. after the player completes this scenario, Delfador leaves. Foreshadow that now.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:310
msgid ""
"How soon, Kaylan? I suspect Elensefar to be under siege as well — I cannot "
"leave Maddock to fight alone, yet neither can I leave the prince unguarded."
msgstr ""
"Kaylan、どの程度かかる？今頃は Elensefar も包囲されているかもしれぬ ── "
"Maddock を一人で戦わせるわけにもいかないが、王子をここに無防備に残すわけにも"
"いかぬ。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:315
msgid ""
"Welcome, young Konrad! It is an honor to once again lay eyes upon the true "
"heir of Wesnoth. The false queen’s forces have caught us unprepared, but the "
"bulk of my riders shall soon return to rout the enemy and seize our victory!"
msgstr ""
"Konrad、よく来てくれた！Wesnoth の真の後継者と再び対面できて大変光栄だ。偽り"
"の女王の軍勢に不意を突かれたが、我が軍の主力もすぐに戻る。それまで耐えれば容"
"易に敵を撃退できよう！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:319
msgid ""
"I’m glad to be here, but sorry we couldn’t come sooner. For how long must we "
"defend before your reinforcements arrive?"
msgstr ""
"無事なようで安心しました。ここへ来るのが遅れてしまって申し訳ありません。それ"
"で、援軍が戻るまでどの程度耐えればよいのでしょうか？"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:324
msgid ""
"If we can hold Blackwater for just a few more days, victory shall be "
"assured! I am encircled and trapped in the port, but with your help the "
"siege can be broken. Hearken to my words, Konrad, and Blackwater Port shall "
"yet endure!"
msgstr ""
"黒水港をあと数日保たせれば、勝利は確実だ！私は港で包囲され、身動きが取れない"
"が、Konrad の助けがあれば包囲も崩せよう。Konrad、どうか私の言葉に耳を傾けてく"
"れ、そうしてくれれば黒水港は今後も安泰だ！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:333
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:283
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:638
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:350
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:340
msgid "Survive until turns run out"
msgstr "ターンが尽きるまで生き残る"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: description=<span strikethrough='true' color='#A9A9A9'>, condition=win
#. if Kaylan is protected, Konrad will learn to recruit Cavalrymen and Horsemen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:340
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:348
msgid "Protect Sir Kaylan: recruit Cavalrymen and Horsemen"
msgstr "Kaylan 卿を守る：竜騎兵と騎兵を雇用可能"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:361
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:274
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:273
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:340
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:268
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:238
msgid "Defeat all enemy leaders"
msgstr "全ての敵リーダーを倒す"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. This is an objective note. Completing this objective will be very hard, but you gain an early finish bonus and a loyal unit.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:363
msgid "(very hard: early finish bonus &#38; loyal companion)"
msgstr "（極めて困難：早期終了ボーナス &#38; 忠実な仲間）"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:383
msgid ""
"Brothers-in-arms, fighting side-by-side! Not since the death of the old king "
"have I felt this way, young Konrad. If I have but one regret in my life, it "
"is that I could not raise you here as my own."
msgstr ""
"戦友たちよ、肩を並べて戦おうぞ！若き Konrad よ、このような気持ちになったのは"
"先王が身罷って以来だ。人生で唯一後悔していることがあるとすれば、あなたをここ"
"で我が子のように育てられなかったことだな。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:387
msgid ""
"Master Delfador told me: You wanted to raise me in Blackwater Port among "
"other humans, but he felt it was too dangerous."
msgstr ""
"この黒水港で、人間の町であなたが私を育てたいと願っていたと、Delfador 師匠から"
"も聞いています。しかし、師匠はそれが危険すぎると思ったようです。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:391
msgid ""
"I don’t mind though. I like elves, and we still got to come visit you "
"sometimes."
msgstr ""
"だからこれでよかったのかもしれません。エルフのことは好きですし、あなたのとこ"
"ろも時々は訪問できていましたから。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:395
msgid ""
"And I was quite right, too. A military town is no place for a young child; "
"Blackwater Port has seen its fair share of battles since I first rescued "
"you, Konrad."
msgstr ""
"そして私の予感も正しかった。軍隊の町は子供にはあまりよろしくない。Konrad  を"
"救ったあの日以降、黒水港では多くの戦いがあったからな。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:406
msgid "Vygwyn"
msgstr "Vygwyn"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:407
msgid "Gaebryn"
msgstr "Gaebryn"

#. [message]: speaker=Vygwyn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:411
msgid ""
"Hail, Sir Kaylan! We rode as swiftly as we could, and come to aid in the "
"defense! The others will arrive soon — do not despair!"
msgstr ""
"Kaylan 卿！防衛に助力すべく、全速力で戻りました！他の者達もすぐに戻ります ── "
"まだまだこれからです！"

#. [message]: speaker=Vygwyn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:416
msgid ""
"Hail, is anyone still alive? We rode as swiftly as we could, and come to aid "
"in the defense. Do not despair — the rest of your reinforcements will soon "
"arrive!"
msgstr ""
"まだ生き残りはいるか？防衛に助力すべく全速力で戻った。諦めるな ── 他の者達も"
"すぐに戻ってくるぞ！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:463
msgid "Yredd"
msgstr "Yredd"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:464
msgid "Tarcyn"
msgstr "Tarcyn"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:465
msgid "Syryn"
msgstr "Syryn"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:466
msgid "Cicyn"
msgstr "Cicyn"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:467
msgid "Ginvan"
msgstr "Ginvan"

#. [unit]: id=Haldiel, type=Horseman
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:471
msgid "Haldiel"
msgstr "Haldiel"

#. [unit]: type=Knight, id=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:486
msgid "Simyr"
msgstr "Simyr"

#. [message]: speaker=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:513
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:554
msgid ""
"Your promised reinforcements have arrived! Time to drive back the false "
"queen’s troops from the port!"
msgstr "待たせたな、援軍の到着だ！さあ、港から偽りの女王の軍勢を駆逐するぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:518
msgid ""
"Our promised reinforcements have arrived! Time to drive back the false "
"queen’s troops from the port!"
msgstr "やっと戻ってきたか！それでは港から偽りの女王の軍勢を排除するぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Mokolo Qimur
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:523
msgid ""
"So many foul humans riding on horses! Asheviere isn’t paying me nearly "
"enough for this. Let’s get out of here!"
msgstr ""
"馬に乗ったクソ人間がこんなにたくさん！Asheviere からもらった金じゃ割に合わ"
"ん。さっさとずらかるぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=enemy1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:528
msgid "The enemy has been reinforced! Quick, we must make our escape!"
msgstr "敵の援軍だ！急げ、我々も早く撤退するぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=enemy2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:533
msgid "Retreat! Fall back!"
msgstr "撤退だ！退くぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:559
msgid ""
"Reinforcements have arrived, but lo! Together we have already managed to "
"repel the false queen’s attack!"
msgstr ""
"援軍が到着したか。しかし遅かったな。見よ！偽りの女王の軍勢は我々だけで撃退し"
"てしまったぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:586
msgid ""
"Victory is ours — but at such cost! Where is the lord of the town? What has "
"become of Sir Kaylan?"
msgstr ""
"我々の勝利だ ── しかしなんということだ！この町の領主はどこに？Kaylan 卿は一体"
"どうなってしまったのか？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:590
msgid ""
"Uncle Kaylan— <b>Sir</b> Kaylan fought bravely... but in the end he fell, "
"pierced by Asheviere’s spears. It is thanks to his sacrifice that Blackwater "
"Port still stands free."
msgstr ""
"おじさん── Kaylan 卿は勇敢に戦い… そして Asheviere の槍に倒れました。Kaylan "
"卿の犠牲があったからこそ、黒水港は今も自由を保つことができています……"

#. [message]: speaker=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:597
msgid ""
"Alas, this is ill news indeed. A hero’s death, but a death nonetheless. "
"Kaylan had hoped to send some of our number with you on your journey, but "
"with his passing we cannot afford to send the Horsemen and Cavalrymen he had "
"hoped to."
msgstr ""
"なんということだ。英雄的な死だ。それでも死であることに変わりはない。Kaylan は"
"騎兵や竜騎兵をあなたの旅に同行させたいと願っていたが、Kaylan 亡き今、我々にそ"
"のような余裕は無い。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haldiel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:601
msgid ""
"Yet with Asheviere’s armies defeated today, surely we can spare at least a "
"few of our number? Though it is true that the bulk of our forces must remain "
"behind to guard the port, we can still partially fufill Sir Kaylan’s last "
"wish, Sir Simyr."
msgstr ""
"しかし、Asheviere の軍勢を今日打ち破ったのですから、少数ならばなんとかならな"
"いでしょうか？もちろん、港の防衛を考えると多くは出せませんが、Kaylan 卿のご遺"
"志を少しだけでも叶えることはできませんか、Simyr 卿。"

#. [message]: speaker=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:605
msgid ""
"Very well. Haldiel and I shall join you on your quest, Your Royal Highness."
msgstr ""
"そうだな。それでは Haldiel と私が同行することにしよう。よろしくお願いいたしま"
"す、殿下。"

#. [message]: speaker=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:615
msgid ""
"Alas, this is ill news indeed. A hero’s death, but a death nonetheless. "
"Kaylan had hoped to send some of our number with you on your journey, but "
"with his passing we can no longer afford to. Konrad, you will have to "
"journey on from here with only Peasants and Woodsmen by your side."
msgstr ""
"なんということだ。英雄的な死だ。それでも死であることに変わりはない。Kaylan は"
"騎兵や竜騎兵をあなたの旅に同行させたいと願っていたが、Kaylan 亡き今、我々にそ"
"のような余裕は無い。Konrad、ここから先、あなたは農民と木こりだけを伴って旅を"
"続けなければならない。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:623
msgid ""
"A glorious victory — thank you for your help, compatriots! I must remain "
"here to safeguard the port, but with the false queen’s troops repelled many "
"of my riders are free to accompany you on your quest. Konrad, may they serve "
"you well!"
msgstr ""
"輝かしい勝利だ ── 同胞よ、協力に感謝する！さて、私はここで港を守らねばならな"
"いが、ここで偽りの女王の軍勢を撃退できたのだから、部下達をあなたに同行させて"
"も大丈夫だろう。Konrad のために力を尽くしてくれよう！"

#. [else]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:625
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Cavalrymen and Horsemen!"
msgstr "Konrad は「竜騎兵」と「騎兵」を雇用できるようになりました！"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:634
msgid ""
"... and with the invading force so thoroughly defeated, I can afford to give "
"you more riders than I had originally planned. Haldiel, Simyr, step forward! "
"I place your lances in the service of His Highness here. May you help him "
"restore order to the country."
msgstr ""
"……そうだな、ここまで完全に打ち負かしたのだから、当初の予定よりも多くの騎兵を"
"送っても大丈夫であろう。Haldiel、Simyr、前に出よ！これより、お前たちは殿下の"
"ためにランスを振るうのだ。殿下をお助けし、この国の秩序を取り戻す一助となって"
"欲しい。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaylan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:639
msgid ""
"... and with the invading force so thoroughly defeated, I can afford to give "
"you more riders than I had originally planned. Haldiel, step forward! I "
"place your lance in the service of His Highness here. May you help him "
"restore order to the country."
msgstr ""
"……そうだな、ここまで完全に打ち負かしたのだから、当初の予定よりも多くの騎兵を"
"送っても大丈夫であろう。Haldiel、前に出よ！これより、お前は殿下のためにランス"
"を振るうのだ。殿下をお助けし、この国の秩序を取り戻す一助となって欲しい。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haldiel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:652
msgid "Greetings, young master. I pledge myself to your service."
msgstr "若様、ご挨拶申し上げます。これより若様にお仕えすることを誓います。"

#. [message]: speaker=Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:657
msgid "It is my pleasure and honor to serve, my liege."
msgstr "お仕えすることを大変光栄に存じます、我が君よ。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:676
msgid "I have failed in my duty to protect the rightful heir and the port..."
msgstr "正当なる後継者とこの港を守るという責務を果たせぬとは…"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:683
msgid "Kaylan, no! Please, you have to get back up! You have to keep fighting!"
msgstr "そんな、おじさん！お願いだから立ち上がって！負けちゃダメだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:690
msgid "I’m sorry, Konrad. He is lost to us now... Today we mourn a good man..."
msgstr "Konrad、すまない。卿は逝ってしまった… 今はこの立派な男の死を悼もう…"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/03_Blackwater_Port.cfg:697
msgid "He’s gone, isn’t he... Today we mourn a good man."
msgstr "逝ってしまったのか… 今はただこの立派な人を悼もう…"

#. [message]: speaker=1Mer1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:133
msgid ""
"Are you coming to liberate us? Finally, we stand a chance against the orcs!"
msgstr ""
"私たちを解放しに来てくれたのですか？ついにオークに立ち向かうチャンスが巡って"
"きた！"

#. [message]: speaker=4Mer1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:140
msgid "Now that we are free, together we can defeat our oppressors!"
msgstr "自由になれたぞ、さあ、一緒にあいつらをぶちのめそうぜ！"

#. [message]: speaker=5Mer1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:147
msgid "Let’s take back the Trident the orcs stole from us!"
msgstr "オークに取られたトライデントを取り戻すぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=6Mer1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:154
msgid ""
"Death to the orcs! Come, my brethren, let us fight the orcs and drive them "
"from our shores!"
msgstr "オークに死を！同胞よ、奴らを俺たちの海岸から追い払うぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=8Mer1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:161
msgid "Thank you for rescuing us! Now we can help you fight the evil orcs!"
msgstr "助けてくれてありがとうな！俺達もクソオークとの戦いを手伝うぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=9Mer1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:168
msgid "Freedom! Now where are those orcs? Let me at ’em!"
msgstr "やっと自由になれた！さて、オークはどこだ？ぶっ飛ばしてやる！"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:277
msgid "scenario name^The Bay of Pearls"
msgstr "真珠の入り江"

