#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:845
msgid "We are vanquished, for I have been defeated!"
msgstr "我々の敗北だ！なぜなら、私が負けてしまったからだ！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:846
msgid "This is the end! Without me, who will guide the prince?"
msgstr "これまでか！私がいなくなったら、誰が王子を導くというのか？"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:847
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:848
msgid "Fight on without me, friends! The Light shall always prevail!"
msgstr "友よ、後は頼んだぞ！光は必ず勝利するのだ！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:849
msgid "Ah’m not wounded! Jus’ need a moment... ta catch my breath..."
msgstr "俺は怪我なんかしちゃいねぇ！ちょっとだけ… 息を整えれば……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:850
msgid "Well, this is a new experience..."
msgstr "あら、これは新しい経験ですね……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:851
msgid "Harper! No!"
msgstr "Harper！そんな！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:851
msgid "Unngh... Sorry Baldras..."
msgstr "うーん… ごめん、Baldras……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:852
msgid "Ack! I tried my best..."
msgstr "うぐっ！まあ、やれるだけのことはやったか……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:852
msgid "Somf! No!"
msgstr "Somf！そんな！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:853
msgid "Chantal! A dark shadow falls upon my soul..."
msgstr "Chantal！私の魂に暗い影が落ちる……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:853
msgid "—Oh!"
msgstr "──あっ！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:854
msgid "Dosh don’ feel so good..."
msgstr "Dosh 気分悪い……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:855
msgid "Krawww..."
msgstr "クラァァ……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:857
msgid "Send word of my fall to Sir Kaylan, Konrad! I fought my best..."
msgstr "Konrad、Kaylan 卿にお伝えください！私は全力を尽くしたと……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:858
msgid ""
"Tell Sir Kaylan of my demise, Konrad... I have served you as best I could..."
msgstr "Konrad、Kaylan 卿に伝えてくれ… 私は精一杯あなたにお仕えましたと……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:859
msgid "Oh... I suppose I deserve this..."
msgstr "おお… まあ、当然の報いなのだろうな……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:860
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "うっ！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:861
msgid "Jotha regrets nothing..."
msgstr "Jotha に後悔は無い……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:862
msgid "Bury me back home in the Dulatus..."
msgstr "故郷の Dulatus に葬ってくれ……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:866
msgid "At least I die an honorable death..."
msgstr "少なくとも、誇り高く死ぬことはできそうだ…"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:868
msgid "Gah! At least I die a death worthy of the Horse Lords of old..."
msgstr "くそ！しかし、少なくとも伝統ある騎兵貴族に相応しい死ではあるか……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:869
msgid "Argh! I may fall, but the Clans shall always endure!"
msgstr "うぐっ！私はここまでだが、クランは永遠に滅びない！"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:870
msgid "Ack! Bury me under the Horse Plains..."
msgstr "うっ！馬平原に私を葬ってくれ……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:871
msgid "Bah! Tell the Clans I died fighting..."
msgstr "フン！私は戦って死んだとクランに伝えて……"

#. [message]: speaker=Galdrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:879
msgid "I have met my match..."
msgstr "手強い奴に会ってしまったな…"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:885
msgid ""
"Tie him up and bind his wounds. The queen will want to make an example of "
"this one."
msgstr ""
"この男を縛り上げて傷を治療しろ。女王陛下はこの男を見せしめにするだろう。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ethiliel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:895
msgid "I have given all in defense of my home..."
msgstr "家を守るために全力を尽くしたのに…"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:901
msgid "Bind her arms and wings! The queen wants their leaders taken alive."
msgstr ""
"この女の腕と羽を縛れ！女王陛下はリーダーを生け捕りにするよう望んでいる。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:915
msgid ""
"Argh! I am nearly finished! But if I were to die here, my people would be "
"left leaderless."
msgstr ""
"ううっ！このままではまずい！私がここで死んだら、我が民が指導者を失ってしま"
"う。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:919
msgid ""
"I have aided you in what ways I could, Konrad. Now I must leave your party, "
"and retreat eastwards to Lintanir Forest. May we someday meet again there."
msgstr ""
"Konrad、できるだけの手助けはした。私はここでお前の一団から離れ、東の "
"Lintanir の森に戻ろうと思う。いつかそこで再会できることを願っている。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:937
msgid "I can’t believe it should end like this!"
msgstr "こんな最期なんて信じられないわ！"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:951
msgid "At least I die alongside my princess..."
msgstr "少なくとも、王女殿下の側で死ぬことはできる……"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:967
msgid "Death of Konrad"
msgstr "Konrad の死"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:975
msgid "Death of Konrad or Delfador"
msgstr "Konrad または Delfador の死"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:983
msgid "Death of Konrad or Li’sar"
msgstr "Konrad または Li’sar の死"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:991
msgid "Death of Konrad, Delfador, or Li’sar"
msgstr "Konrad、Delfador、Li’sar いずれかの死"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:1004
msgid ""
"Delfador is a leader, and can recruit elementals when standing on a keep."
msgstr "Delfador はリーダーで、主塔にいるとき精霊を雇用できます。"
